{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the depths of darkness in <i>Bandido Rush</i>, a high-stakes platformer where precision, speed, and skill are your only allies. Trapped deep within a collapsing gold mine, you play as a fearless Mexican bandido armed only with his trusty six-shooter and sheer determination. To survive, you must master the art of airborne movement, using your revolver\u2019s powerful recoil to propel yourself through the air and navigate deadly terrain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRECISION POWER MOVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through the air with your revolver, chaining precise shots to overcome treacherous gaps and deadly obstacles.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/1b0b2bd96e33a66731ed1ba25dec85ec.poster.avif?t=1772731685\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/1b0b2bd96e33a66731ed1ba25dec85ec.webm?t=1772731685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/1b0b2bd96e33a66731ed1ba25dec85ec.mp4?t=1772731685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HAND-CRAFTED WORLDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore uniquely designed levels, each introducing fresh mechanics and challenges that push your skills to the limit.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/39f6fe9ba2752dc3be0cd0bebfad37f8.poster.avif?t=1772731685\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/39f6fe9ba2752dc3be0cd0bebfad37f8.webm?t=1772731685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/39f6fe9ba2752dc3be0cd0bebfad37f8.mp4?t=1772731685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>HARDCORE PLATFORMING ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle brutal, fast-paced levels that demand split-second decisions and relentless perseverance.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/f08ba6e46a071413b9f4e6f0e27fcb15.poster.avif?t=1772731685\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/f08ba6e46a071413b9f4e6f0e27fcb15.webm?t=1772731685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/f08ba6e46a071413b9f4e6f0e27fcb15.mp4?t=1772731685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>INSTANT RESPAWNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fail fast, learn faster. Quick restarts keep you in the action and ready to conquer each challenge.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/5e80eb3a16fb66b232a36891188b6206.poster.avif?t=1772731685\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/5e80eb3a16fb66b232a36891188b6206.webm?t=1772731685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/5e80eb3a16fb66b232a36891188b6206.mp4?t=1772731685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPEED-RUN YOUR WAY TO THE TOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Perfect your runs and beat the clock, proving yourself as the ultimate bandido.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/21af13b465c0c9c89dc558ec62ef1ec4.poster.avif?t=1772731685\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/21af13b465c0c9c89dc558ec62ef1ec4.webm?t=1772731685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/extras/21af13b465c0c9c89dc558ec62ef1ec4.mp4?t=1772731685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Can you break free before the mine becomes your tomb? The clock is tickin', your only way out is ARRIBA!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405910?t=1772731685","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3405910?t=1772731685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/e7e759f77feb4cdb8dc9a50aff1be4c21a5d1f30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772731685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405910/e7e759f77feb4cdb8dc9a50aff1be4c21a5d1f30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772731685","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the depths of darkness in <i>Bandido Rush</i>, a high-stakes platformer where precision, speed, and skill are your only allies. Trapped deep within a collapsing gold mine, you play as a fearless Mexican bandido armed only with his trusty six-shooter and sheer determination. To survive, you must master the art of airborne movement, using your revolver\u2019s powerful recoil to propel yourself through the air and n